				<title>SCP-5458</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5458</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;scale EN-base&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;class1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;level-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base false EN&quot;&gt;2/5458&lt;/span&gt; LEVEL &lt;span class=&quot;base false EN&quot;&gt;2/5458&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;class-text&quot;&gt;CLASSIFIED&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;class1image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/component:classified-bar-woed-source/classified-lv2.svg&quot; alt=&quot;classified-lv2.svg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;item1 EN&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;itemnum EN&quot;&gt;Item #: SCP-5458&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;objclass EN&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;obj-left&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;obj-right Euclid&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;obj-text&quot;&gt;Euclid&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/776315544198316042/776315580859940864/SCP-5458.JPG&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot; alt=&quot;SCP-5458.JPG&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5458 taken at [REDACTED]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5458 is to be contained in an 8m x 4m x 4m air-tight, steel cell. A ventilator and a tube connecting to a hydrogen chloride (HCL) tank are needed in the cell. Surveillance cameras and a thermometer are also to be installed. The enclosure must not have any sources that could change the cell&#039;s temperature except for SCP-5458 itself. The cell also must have an air-tight vestibule door.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anyone who enters the cell must wear air-tight clothing and a gas mask; no skin can be exposed. The SCP-5458-1 neutralization procedures also need to take place every five days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5458 is an anomalous Brunswick piano currently kept at Site-█. SCP-5458 must be constantly performed without any mistakes made when played. If any of this is violated, a transparent gas capable of corroding through human flesh will be released from the back of SCP-5458 within 20 seconds. The gas is classified as SCP-5458-1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5458-1 can be produced infinitely by SCP-5458; it is currently impossible to find the cause of the production, and it is impossible to stop the production permanently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;According to the results of experiments tested on D-Class subjects by Doctor ██████, when exposing a human to SCP-5458-1 without any protective clothing, the subject will die within 2 - 5 minutes due to blood loss if not treated properly and 10 - 25 seconds if inhaled, making the gas very dangerous to humans. It is also tested that when SCP-5458-1 is released, it will significantly increase the surrounding environment&#039;s temperature. This can be used to detect SCP-5458-1&#039;s presence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5458-1 cannot be destroyed but can be neutralized into SCP-5458-2 when reacted with hydrogen chloride. SCP-5458-2 is not corrosive, nor does it have any adverse effects on humans. SCP-5458-2 is usually ventilated out of the building after the SCP-5458-1 neutralization procedure is complete. Interestingly, SCP-5458-2 is weighed to be 1.29 times lighter than hydrogen gas, which is an anomaly thought to be scientifically impossible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5458-1 Neutralization Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bleach will first be applied onto SCP-5458 to protect the entity from any corrosion of the chemicals. 108L of hydrogen chloride will then be released into the cell. It will take approximately 5 minutes for the hydrogen chloride to neutralize all present SCP-5458-1. Extra hydrogen chloride is then to be released, and the cell is to be left for five additional minutes before ventilating all SCP-5458-2 and remaining hydrogen chloride out of the building. Fresh air will then be released back into the cell.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery and Investigation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5458 was first located in an abandoned house in ████ ██████, Israel. It was found in a basement with four human remains and an old man performing on the entity. SCP-5458 was seized during an MTF Beta-7 (&amp;quot;Maz Hatters&amp;quot;) raid when three residents and a local policeman were reported missing after exploring the house. An MTF agent (B7-3) and the old man were both killed due to contact with SCP-5458-1.&lt;br /&gt;
After a thorough investigation of the house, traces of a cult named &amp;quot;Isaiah Lebar&amp;quot; were found. Ethnicity DNA tests from bloodstains also lead to an Israeli village called Quaal. MTF agents searched Quaal for the cult. However, no traces were found except a book titled «Testaments of Isaiah Lebar».&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below is a section of the transmission log between Doctor ██████ and three MTF Beta-7 team members (B7-1, B7-2, and B7-3). This was recorded when the anomaly was identified in the house and when B7-3 and the old man were killed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exploration Transmission Log Transcript&lt;br /&gt;
Date: ██/██/████&lt;br /&gt;
Exploration Team: MTF Beta-7 (&amp;quot;Haz Matters&amp;quot;)&lt;br /&gt;
Subject: SCP-5458&lt;br /&gt;
Team Members: B7-1, B7-2, B7-3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Doctor ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; B7 team, do you copy?&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-1:&lt;/strong&gt; Copy, sir.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-2:&lt;/strong&gt; Copy.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-3:&lt;/strong&gt; I copy.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-2:&lt;/strong&gt; Oh, it’s starting to smell really bad down there.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-3:&lt;/strong&gt; Gosh, it’s&amp;#8230; bad.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Doctor ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Keep going, don’t stop.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Doctor ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Do you guys hear anything?&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-1:&lt;/strong&gt; Not really… Wait, no, I hear some sort of music.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-2:&lt;/strong&gt; I think it is a piano.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Doctor ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; That’s right, go in, go in the room quickly, put on your masks.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-1:&lt;/strong&gt; We have it on, we are entering the room now.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-2:&lt;/strong&gt; We are in, it appears that someone is playing on a piano&amp;#8230;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-3:&lt;/strong&gt; The room is stained with rotten blood, there are corpses everywhere what the hell!&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Doctor ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; You guys are on track, seize this &amp;quot;someone&amp;quot; and the piano&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-2:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes sir.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-1:&lt;/strong&gt; Get onto the floor now!&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-2:&lt;/strong&gt; He seems to be an old man.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-2:&lt;/strong&gt; Do not move, stay on the floor. You [INAUDIBLE] are gunna get your self killed.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-3:&lt;/strong&gt; He’s being handcuffed.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-1:&lt;/strong&gt; [INAUDIBLE].&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-2:&lt;/strong&gt; There are many corpses around here, from the texture, I think it has been rotting for a while&amp;#8230;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Doctor ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Good job, you guys need backup?&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-1:&lt;/strong&gt; Room is clear, we need backup to carry the piano.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-3:&lt;/strong&gt; It’s getting very hard to breath.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Doctor ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Sending more agents in. You guys will have to wait for three minutes. Do you copy?&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-2:&lt;/strong&gt; Copy.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-1:&lt;/strong&gt; I copy, sir.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-3:&lt;/strong&gt; Aw fuck! It hurts! Shit. Ouch. I’m gunna start bleeding!&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Doctor ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Evade the room. Dash three do you copy? What is happening?&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-2:&lt;/strong&gt; Call for medical backup, dash three is bleeding uncontrollably, we are unsure why.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Doctor ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Help is on the way, where exactly are you bleeding? Do you have your&lt;br /&gt;
ma-&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-3:&lt;/strong&gt; NO DAMNIT I DON’T, FUCK, SHIT IT HURTS LIKE HELL! PLEASE&amp;#8230; HELP ME.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-1:&lt;/strong&gt; dash three didn’t have his mask on, I think it is [INAUDIBLE] some form of gas. We are evading him out of the room currently, shit, his head looks like a tomato. Blood is everywhere.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-3:&lt;/strong&gt; [INAUDIBLE], I am gunna die!&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Doctor ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Dash three, do you copy? Dash three?&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-2:&lt;/strong&gt; He’s unconscious, sir.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Doctor ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Evade the room immediately.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-1&lt;/strong&gt;: Shit, I think he is dead.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-2&lt;/strong&gt;: The old man is also bleeding, it is screaming sir.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Doctor ██████:&lt;/strong&gt; Forget about the old man, do NOT take off your masks, get the hell out and close the damn door. Do you copy?&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-2:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes sir.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;B7-1:&lt;/strong&gt; Copy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
