nfo/dododevil" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1854139&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606078066" alt="DodoDevil" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1854139)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dododevil" >DodoDevil</a></span>.</li> <li>📈 <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4584">SCP-4584</a> (&quot;cold dreams.&quot;) - As coldest as the winter Kanye sung about, one day. Freezed by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394107&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606078066" alt="chiifu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394107)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" >chiifu</a></span>.</li> <li>📈 <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1020-j">SCP-1020-J</a> (&quot;Fridge Horror&quot;) - Expired food is more horrifying than anything you could ever dream. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1229263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606078066" alt="Roget" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1229263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" >Roget</a></span>.</li> <li>📈 <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5896">SCP-5896</a> (&quot;Windows 95 for Elders&quot;) - It's never too late for learning how the Internet works! If you follow the instructions of this book made by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edna-granbo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2212713&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606078066" alt="Edna Granbo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2212713)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edna-granbo" >Edna Granbo</a></span>, you will know everything about that!</li> </ul> <h4><span>Tales</span></h4> <ul> <li>📈 <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/that-divine-strife">Remember Me as a Time of Day</a> - &quot;<em>Your generation's new-fangled slang is always amiss, bhaiji</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/popsioak" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5231418&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606078066" alt="Popsioak" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5231418)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/popsioak" >Popsioak</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/strange-beasts">Strange Beasts</a> - &quot;<em>You can learn a lot about yourself from the stories you seek out. Sometimes even things you didn't know were true.</em>&quot; Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/daviiid" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6403884&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606078066" alt="daviiid" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6403884)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/daviiid" >daviiid</a></span>.</li> </ul> <h4><span>Misc</span></h4> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/canon-jp-2">evilFoundation - Secure. Contain. Predominate.</a> - Ethics and protection of humanity? Bitch, please, it's so outdated. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tokage-otoko" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1719604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606078066" alt="tokage-otoko" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1719604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tokage-otoko" >tokage-otoko</a></span>, translated by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/int-translator" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4721888&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606078066" alt="INT_Translator" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4721888)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/int-translator" >INT_Translator</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/top-rated-jokes">Top Rated Joke Articles</a> - These articles will totally give you a good laugh, because numbers never lie. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2893766&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606078066" alt="Croquembouche" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2893766)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" >Croquembouche</a></span>.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/top-rated-goi-formats">Top Rated Group of Interest Formats</a> - Few people know how the Groups of Interest write about things that happened to us. This time is close to an end. Written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2893766&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606078066" alt="Croquembouche" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2893766)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" >Croquembouche</a></span>.</li> </ul> <h3><span>Canon Renaissance Contest Entries</span></h3> <h3><span>Fanart</span></h3> <h5><span>Here you will find a selection of artists whose art output is worth following. The thumbnails are clickable.</span></h5> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:larger;"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/ananomalouswriter